                <pb facs="0570" n="446" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg446"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/2763: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morales</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-12-03T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 3,
                                1923—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>49. Legation’s December 1, 10 a.m.</p>
                <p>Under present conditions the Department does not consider it advisable to have a
                    warship sent to Amapala.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
